      <article class="persona-card">
        <div class="persona-header">
          <img src="https://delphi.one/images/user-1.avif" alt="Joe RIA" class="persona-avatar">
          <h3>This is Joe, the RIA</h3>
        </div>
        <p>As an RIA, Joe is overwhelmed with requests from clients for stock tips and portfolio updates — their underlying question being, "Where's the money?" Juggling the tasks of prospecting, servicing current clients, and account retention leaves him with little time for comprehensive research. Joe is in search of a shortcut to bypass exhaustive research papers, aiming instead for concise, actionable insights that will enhance his credibility and effectiveness in the eyes of his clients.</p>
      </article>

