          <h3>This is Joe the DIY investor</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Joe has just cashed out and now enjoys managing his own investment portfolio. Like many DIY investors, Joe's challenge isn't finding investment ideas; it's vetting them without spending all his time on research. What's the value of time-efficient, high-quality research to Joe? Imagine having access to the same insights that industry insiders like Ray Dalio enjoy, all without the heavy lifting.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="persona-card">
